* 2N2647 Precision Unijunction Transistor (UJT) SPICE Subcircuit Model
* Pin Order: E=1, B1=2, B2=3
.SUBCKT 2N2647 1 2 3
DE 1 4 EMITTER
VE 4 5 DC 0
HVE 6 0 VE 1K
RVE 0 6 1MEG
GBB 5 7 POLY(2) (5,7) (6,0) 0 0.00025 0 0 0.00620
CBB 5 7 30P
RB1 7 2 RMOD 3.500
RB2 3 5 RMOD 2.800K
.MODEL RMOD RES(R=1, TC1=0.01)
.MODEL EMITTER D (IS=15.0P N=1.8)
.ENDS 2N2647
